{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785993583707826001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"fizzy-tenor-null","assignee":"","attestations":{"plan-review":{"algorithm":"HMAC-SHA256","author":"Iso Tester","head_sha":"08cd4c325490f56045eb9ec0a8867320f491ff26","key_id":"412fa5372ad877e0","kind":"plan-review","manifest":["plan-review: PASS","ticket: 476f-9751-c737-469a","material: f895d0297c322bd5","model: claude-opus-4-8","runner: pydantic_ai","blocking: 0","advisory: 10","regver: 0dbaa5513314ac56","dep a682229c42aa6bf7c54d0f7dc88f06bcc39f9eb6d32c6ef96e041a2896b1385c src/rebar/llm/eval.py","dep absent src/rebar/llm/eval_scorers.py","dep absent tests/unit/test_eval_scorers.py"],"signature":"35d8691b92f7370fe09e83aef7da30f60640f58173bc0c9fa726a754b86edd70","signed_at":1782580836073135000}},"author":"Iso Tester","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":9},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Iso Tester","body":"G3 container coverage audit (parent WS-EVAL-EXISTING vs this child + full sibling roster): clean. Child 476f fully covers parent AC2 (deterministic-scorer registry mapping every name used by all 7 specs to a pure function; validate_scorer rejects unregistered names) and contributes the dataset-schema/shape-validation half of AC4. Remaining parent ACs are covered by siblings (AC1 specs → c156; AC3 run_eval/solver → 4569 + 7402; AC4 CI + offline balance/gold_set tests → c156; AC5 eval-live workflow → 4569). No parent acceptance criterion is left uncovered by the union of children.","timestamp":1782579769298707001},{"author":"Iso Tester","body":"Implemented (T1 / 2.1+2.3):\n- NEW src/rebar/llm/eval_scorers.py: deterministic-scorer REGISTRY (name->pure ScoreResult function). 15 names registered covering all packaged specs + the new specs' names. Archetypes: schema/contract (emits_valid_review_result/_findings/_verdict/_verification), recall (recall_on_*), no-fire (no_fire_on_*/no_false_fail_on_complete), grounding (cites_real_paths), verifier discrimination (discriminates_true_from_false, no_sycophancy_on_real_defects). ScoreResult carries applicable+passed so aggregation (recall/at_least(k)/coverage) is the caller's job (run_eval, T4). Schema scorers delegate to findings.validate_result; cites_real_paths leans on findings.resolve_citations' downgrade contract.\n- eval.py: validate_scorer gains optional known= (rejects unregistered deterministic names); validate_eval_spec gains strict=True (registry enforcement + new validate_dataset_and_gold: non-empty balanced dataset, per-axis balance (fire/pass OR high/low validity), unique ids, reviewer-specific payload field, non-empty gold_set). Defaults unchanged => backward compatible (load_eval_spec/user specs/existing tests untouched).\n- tests/unit/test_eval_scorers.py: 24 tests (scorer behavior + strict validation + all 3 plan-review specs pass strict).\nState check: ruff+mypy clean; 336 related unit tests pass. NOTE: code-quality.eval.yaml fails strict only because it ships gold-only (no dataset) — pre-existing gap, to be closed when wiring the CI strict gate (T4).","timestamp":1782581440860997001}],"created_at":1782578568850053001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[],"description":"# Eval foundation: deterministic-scorer registry + per-reviewer dataset schema (2.1 + 2.3)\n\n## What\n\nBuild the executable substrate the specs name but that does not exist yet.\n- A name->pure-function registry for deterministic scorers in `src/rebar/llm/eval.py`\n  (or a new `src/rebar/llm/eval_scorers.py`), covering the names used by ALL 7 specs:\n  `emits_valid_findings`/`emits_valid_review_result`/`emits_valid_verdict`,\n  `recall_on_*`, `no_fire_on_*`/`no_false_fail_*`, `cites_real_paths`/citation checks.\n- A per-reviewer dataset case schema (validated): fields `id`, `corpus`, `expect`\n  (finding|pass|fail), optional `criterion`/`kind`/`pair`/`mode`/`note`; and the\n  `scan_spec` BATCH unit (one spec + N epic fixtures).\n- Extend `validate_eval_spec`/`validate_scorer` so an unregistered/typo'd deterministic\n  scorer name FAILS the offline gate, and `dataset`/`gold_set` are shape-checked.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `src/rebar/llm/` has a scorer registry mapping every scorer name used by the 7 specs to a pure function over (case, structured_output) -> bool/score.\n- [ ] `validate_scorer` rejects a deterministic scorer whose name is not registered.\n- [ ] A dataset-case schema is defined + validated (id/corpus/expect required; scan_spec batch shape supported).\n- [ ] Unit tests in `tests/unit/` cover the registry, each scorer's pass/fail behavior, and the new validation.\n- [ ] No live model calls; all offline + deterministic.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval_scorers.py","reason":"new deterministic-scorer registry (name->pure-function dispatch)"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/eval.py","reason":"extend validate_scorer/validate_eval_spec to reject unregistered scorer names + shape-check dataset/gold_set"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_eval_scorers.py","reason":"unit tests for the registry + dataset-schema validation"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","b4af-6782-0f12-4a1d"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"b4af-6782-0f12-4a1d","parent_status_uuid":"6bc2a8ca-1c27-48db-be8b-73506706e38e","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"476f-9751-c737-469a","ticket_type":"task","title":"Eval foundation: scorer registry + dataset schema (2.1+2.3)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["73cf01aa-66e6-4360-b060-2a5d7eaad7f0","060559e6-620f-47a4-830e-992f0ab33228","d24fe991-f2c8-4e4e-a28d-ac40dbee0aae","f281eef9-87b3-4f1e-8e22-2904949feb63","a2796b0c-c62e-4966-ba2d-5f665260de9a","6d5be97c-e358-4427-99e7-0bde1907c125","84389848-97d4-42fe-9cf3-e7f8f81c46ab","6bc2a8ca-1c27-48db-be8b-73506706e38e","e63a6791-1e54-4ad3-b26a-fe5923a26869","1c1de8b4-3be0-4207-a06b-9b4f3de29f6a","ad70790a-54bd-4af6-8faf-201bdac22b4a"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785993583707826001,"uuid":"814d500a-d205-4c4b-9a0a-84cea4333f24"}